# Canonical identities for `git log`, `git shortlog` and GitHub's contributors
# graph. Two people have committed here under five name/email pairs, which makes
# `git shortlog -sn` read as five contributors.
#
# This is a DISPLAY mapping only. GitHub links a commit to a profile by the
# author email alone and does not consult this file for that, so commits
# authored as arlo@adaptivesoftwarellc.com still show against the GitHub account
# that owns that address. Fixing that for a given commit means authoring it with
# an address verified on the intended account — hence the canonical form below,
# which is firegiant9000's no-reply address.

